1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,763
So only a tiny fraction of collisions are effective.

2
00:00:03,763 --> 00:00:09,856
The molecules must carry at least a certain minimum energy, the activation energy.

3
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:15,403
And they must meet with the correct orientation, the right atoms facing each other.

